{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12154","headline":"奉和张荆州巡农晚望 · 钱起","name":"奉和张荆州巡农晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太清霁云雷，阳春陶物象。\n明牧行春令，仁风助昇长。\n时和俗勤业，播殖农厥壤。\n阴阴桑陌连，漠漠水田广。\n郡中忽无事，方外还独往。\n日暮驻归轩，湖山有佳赏。\n宣城传逸韵，千载谁此响。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}